acot_note/1001_innovation-design.md:141:| PGIF 去门控 | 0.396 | 14.7s | 20.0s | +0.217 [+0.034,+0.401] / +15.6s [−0.9,+31.9] / −9.3s [−17.8,−1.3] | (c) ✅ |
