acot_note/906_paper_data_inventory.md:3:> 2026-09-06 · ACoT-UAV-Track 写作用:已完成实验 → 可入论文的真实数据(按章节)。**所有数字均为实测,可由 `eval_out/*.json` / `runs/*.log` + `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/continuous_metrics.py` 复现,无一编造。** 配套 memory `acot-uav-paper-writing-kickoff`(叙事定调 + FINAL PINNED NUMBERS)、`acot-uav-reid-reframe`(诊断全链)。
acot_note/906_paper_data_inventory.md:5:**闭环数据可比性(已验证)**:所有 closed-loop rollout 在 CARLA 按 seed 实时生成、不读训练数据、ckpt 固定 `stage2_v5` → 旧批次(`road_*`)与新批次(`paper_*`)**同配置结果一致**(track_correct_frac 0.626≈0.627,SR 0.118=0.118)→ 可同框引用。评测协议:20ep、seeds 91000-19、Town05、STEPS 900、s2=6。
