acot_note/1001_poc-closure.md:4:> 路径约定:`eval_out/` 均指 `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/eval_out/`;日志在 `runs/asd/`。最终稿中 max_wrong(错窗长度)**不作为主 claim**(多个设定 CI 含 0)。
acot_note/1001_poc-closure.md:5:> 证据等级:**[M] 已测**(附路径)· **[H] 假设/待测** · **[P] 部分(n 不足)**。所有闭环臂同协议:Town05、seeds 91000–19、STEPS 900、s2=6、live CARLA,n=19 计分(91004 不计分),同种子配对 bootstrap(`asd_stats.py`)。
acot_note/1001_poc-closure.md:13:| C2 | 漂移检测是杠杆(oracle 上界) | `paper_ext_tahrelm_oracledrift` vs C1:correct +0.449 [+0.345,+0.551]、max_wrong −13.9s | **[M]** |
acot_note/1001_poc-closure.md:15:| D1 | 记忆自置信逐 tick 弱有信息(非不可辨识) | 合并全部 observe 日志,episode bootstrap 95% CI:TAH(30 ep / 1565 tick)自置信 AUROC **0.710 [0.546,0.811]**,冻结外观锚相异度 **0.501 [0.421,0.622]**(=随机);reid(8 ep / 795 tick)自置信 **0.819 [0.792,0.862]**(`carla_uav_tracking/rollout/eval_out/auroc_{tah,reid}_observe.json`)| **[M]** |
acot_note/1001_poc-closure.md:18:| T1 | 自更新 → 误差自相关 → 未回火(独立假设)的贝叶斯滤波会被俘获,比不纠偏更差 | `paper_asd_tah_bayes` vs 基线:correct 0.272→**0.074**,Δ**−0.198 [−0.336,−0.075]**;max_wrong +11.1s [+2.5,+20.6];门控把选择拉离真目标 0.343 > 拉回 0.165。toy 支撑(`carla_uav_tracking/rollout/eval_out/toy_drift.json`)| **[M]** |
acot_note/1001_poc-closure.md:19:| M1 | PGIF(回火证据累积 + 后验门控)显著提升 deployable 身份质量(TAH) | `paper_asd_tah_tempered` vs C1:correct 0.272→**0.613**,Δ**+0.341 [+0.173,+0.511]**;latch@5 0.16→0.58;SR 0→0.158(3/19,McNemar p=0.25,不显著);max_wrong 15.7→10.8s(CI 含 0);门控改写 65% 拉到真目标 / 11% 拉离 | **[M]** |
acot_note/1001_poc-closure.md:21:| M3 | 置信度加权有增益(vs 等权驻留启发式) | PGIF vs 等权驻留:Δcorrect **+0.237 [+0.058,+0.424]**,Δmax_wrong **−6.2s [−12.1,−1.0]**;等权驻留相对基线不显著(+0.104 [−0.071,+0.286])| **[M]** |
